OL,3,AFirst polls open in US midterm
OL,4,Aelections that will shape rest of
OL,5,ATrump's presidency
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt's polling day in the US midterm
OL,8,Felections - millions of Americans are
OL,9,Fvoting to decide who will control
OL,10,FCongress for the final two years of
OL,11,FDonald Trump's presidency
OL,13,FWhat's up for election? All 435 seats
OL,14,Fin the House; 35 of the 100 seats in
OL,15,Fthe Senate; and some state-level
OL,16,Fpoliticians, including governors. See
OL,17,Four basic explainer here
OL,19,FTrump's Republican Party controls the
OL,20,Ftwo chambers of Congress - Democrats
OL,21,Fare hoping to flip enough seats to win
OL,22,Fa majority in both
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
