OL,3,AFirst polls open in US midterm
OL,4,Aelections that will shape rest of
OL,5,ATrump's presidency
OL,6,
OL,7,FIf they control Congress, Democrats
OL,8,Fwould be better placed to block Trump's
OL,9,Fplans, and could also launch
OL,10,Finvestigations into the president and
OL,11,Fhis team. As Anthony Zurcher explains,
OL,12,Fthis could even include an attempt to
OL,13,Fimpeach Trump
